        "kind": "external",
        "statement": "For every smooth mean-zero f, tau>0 and nonnegative integer n, let t_n=n*tau and let q=S_(t_n)f. With the displayed Li-Wu maps F_tau,H_tau, its algebraic step identity is S_(-t_n-tau)[S_tau q+F_tau(q)+H_tau(q)]=f+Stage_(n,tau)(t_n+tau;f)+integral_(t_n)^(t_n+tau) B_s(f,Stage_(n,tau)(s;f))ds-R2_(n,tau)(f,f,f). The R2 has exactly the Fourier phase covariance, sign and coefficient of D012, including zero output.",
